OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fwindy and a few showers continuing to
OL,7,Faffect the west, dry towards Aberdeen
OL,8,Fwith clear spells. Possibly gales
OL,9,Falong the North Aberdeenshire coast
OL,10,Fearly on Sunday morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FWinds gradually easing during
OL,13,Fthe day and Autumn sunshine for most
OL,14,Fareas, any showers in the west
OL,15,Fbecoming isolated, quite a pleasant
OL,16,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
