OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FPatchy
OL,6,Frain at first Monday but then becoming
OL,7,Fdry and feeling a lot warmer. Bright,
OL,8,Fmild start on Tuesday with rain
OL,9,Farriving later. Rain clears Wednesday
OL,10,Fwith bright spells later.
